        <mxCell id="U4i4YUuBkWg8Rtms3iqd-23" connectable="0" parent="U4i4YUuBkWg8Rtms3iqd-20" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];inheritText=1;defaultLabelBackgroundColor=page;" value="(6) Posts/Comments" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" x="0.3038" y="2" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_SqZKSh0F9uX9u_UxSjh-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;ol dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 2em; color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(31, 35, 40), rgb(205, 208, 212));&quot;&gt;The user registers with /register endpoint which stores their password hash.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(31, 35, 40), rgb(205, 208, 212));&quot;&gt;When the user logs in their password is rehashed and compared with the password hash in the auth table. On succesful login a JWT token is provided for authoristion to the posts APIs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(31, 35, 40), rgb(205, 208, 212));&quot;&gt;The token is included in the header for each request.&amp;nbsp; If the user tries to access the posts API endpoints with no token or an invalid token, an erorr is raised&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;&quot;&gt;When a user creates a new post- a new entry is created in the posts table. For each new topic also create a new row in the topics table&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;&quot;&gt;When a user reacts to a post- query the post table to check if post is available and get the author- a new row is created if the user hasn&#39;t reacted before or updated if they have (reactions are blocked if user is the author)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;&quot;&gt;When a user comments on a post- query the post table to check if post is available and get the author- a new row is created with the comment&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;&quot;&gt;When a user wants to view a post. The posts that are not expired are joined with the comments and a group by like types to give the likes/dislikes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="650" width="370" x="30" y="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
